{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60001",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 500,
			"height": 120,
			"text": "# 🏦 BPRS Bangka Belitung\n\n**CMS Platform** — Laravel 11 + Alpine.js + Tailwind CSS\n\nDokumentasi arsitektur dan roadmap pengembangan",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60002",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -80,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 200,
			"height": 100,
			"text": "## ✅ Fase 1\n**Foundation**\n\n- Laravel setup\n- Auth system\n- RBAC roles\n- Admin layout",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60003",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 240,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 200,
			"height": 100,
			"text": "## ✅ Fase 2\n**Content Management**\n\n- News CRUD\n- Products CRUD\n- Hero Slider\n- File uploads",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60004",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 200,
			"height": 100,
			"text": "## ✅ Fase 3\n**Business Features**\n\n- Kas Keliling\n- Auctions\n- Financing Sim\n- Company Info",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60005",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 880,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 200,
			"height": 100,
			"text": "## ✅ Fase 4\n**Security & Performance**\n\n- CSP headers\n- DDoS protection\n- Session security\n- Image optimization",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60006",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1200,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 200,
			"height": 100,
			"text": "## 🚀 Fase 5\n**Current — Polish**\n\n- Frontend redesign\n- Animations\n- Accessibility\n- Mobile optimization",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60007",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 600,
			"y": -20,
			"width": 600,
			"height": 80,
			"text": "## 🗂️ Project Structure\n\n```\napp/\n├── Http/Controllers/   — Auth, Frontend, Admin\n├── Http/Middleware/     — Security, Session, DDoS\n├── Models/              — Eloquent models\n├── Services/            — Business logic\n├── Console/Commands/    — CLI tools\nresources/\n├── views/               — Blade templates\n├── css/                 — Tailwind CSS\n├── js/                  — Alpine.js\nroutes/                  — Web, Auth, Admin\ndatabase/migrations/     — Schema\n```",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60008",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -80,
			"y": 380,
			"width": 350,
			"height": 200,
			"text": "## 🗄️ Database Tables\n\n| Table | Purpose |\n|-------|---------|\n| `users` | User accounts |\n| `roles` / `permissions` | RBAC |\n| `news` | Articles |\n| `products` | Products |\n| `auctions` | Auctions |\n| `hero_slides` | Hero slider |\n| `kas_keliling` | Mobile cash |\n| `company_infos` | Company profile |\n| `security_settings` | Security config |\n| `customer_complaints` | Complaints |\n\n> [!seealso] [[Database Schema]]",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60009",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 380,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 200,
			"text": "## 🏗️ Middleware Stack\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    A[Request] --> B[SecurityHeaders]\n    B --> C[DdosProtection]\n    C --> D[ThreatDetection]\n    D --> E[SecureSession]\n    E --> F[IdleTimeout]\n    F --> G[CheckRole]\n    G --> H[CheckMenu]\n    H --> I[Controller]\n```\n\n> [!seealso] [[Architecture Overview]]",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60010",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 800,
			"y": 380,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 200,
			"text": "## 🎨 Frontend\n\n- **Blade** — Layouts & Components\n- **Alpine.js 3.x** — Interactivity\n- **Tailwind CSS v4** — Styling\n- **Vite** — Building\n\n**Key Components:**\n- Hero slider (responsive images)\n- Card component (reusable)\n- Stats section (animated)\n- Prayer time widget\n- Financing simulator\n\n> [!seealso] [[Frontend Components]]",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60011",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1200,
			"y": 380,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 200,
			"text": "## 🔒 Security Layers\n\n- ✅ CSP with nonces\n- ✅ DDoS protection\n- ✅ Session hijacking detection\n- ✅ Idle timeout\n- ✅ Math CAPTCHA login\n- ✅ Rate limiting\n- ✅ XSS/SQLi detection\n- ✅ Audit trail\n\n> [!seealso] [[Security Setup]]",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60012",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 600,
			"y": 680,
			"width": 600,
			"height": 200,
			"text": "## 🎯 Next Steps — Roadmap\n\n### Short Term\n- [x] Frontend design improvements (animations, micro-interactions)\n- [x] Admin UI consistency (admin-btn, admin-stagger)\n- [x] Accessibility audit (labels, aria, skip-to-content)\n- [x] Mobile responsiveness audit\n\n### Medium Term\n- [ ] SEO audit (meta tags, structured data)\n- [ ] Image optimization (srcset, WebP/AVIF rollout)\n- [ ] Performance optimization (Lighthouse 90+)\n- [ ] Unit & feature tests\n\n### Long Term\n- [ ] Automated deployment\n- [ ] Monitoring & alerting\n- [ ] CDN integration\n- [ ] PWA support",
			"color": "2"
		}
	],
